@baseUrl = https://localhost:7119

### 1. Submit a government form (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formType": "CertificateOfIndigency",
  "applicantFullName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "email": "juan.delacruz@example.com",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "fields": {
    "purpose": "Scholarship Application",
    "address": "Barangay San Lorenzo, Makati"
  }
}

### 2. Look up a submission by reference code (GET)
### Replace GOV-... with the referenceCode returned from the POST response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/submissions/GOV-20261119-ABCDEF